  "messages": [
    {
      "displayText": "¡Este es el Torneo Lilette Suprême Infinito,\ndonde podrás batirte contra moi hasta el fin<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nde los tiempos!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 0,
      "offsetInSection": 164,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 113
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Creo que no necesita más explicación, pero,\ncomo soy tan educada, te lo explico...<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nSe trata de un torneo en el que tú y yo somos l<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿāoas\núnic<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿāoas participantes, y en el que deberás luchar<U+0010><U+0001>븀\ncontra mí, y nadie más, para acumular victorias.<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nHas-ta-el-in-fi-ni-to.♥<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 13,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 392,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 280
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Yo, a cambio, y con toda la bondad de mi corazón,\nme aseguraré de llevar la cuenta de tus victorias<U+0010><U+0001>븀\ny de dejar anotada tu mejor racha.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 952,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 142
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Tu récord es de <U+0010><U+0003>ȅ<U+0002>  victoria<U+0010><U+0003>ᄁ<U+0002>Ās contra mí!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 9,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 1236,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A1005400750020007200E90063006F0072006400200065007300200064006500200010000302050002202F00200076006900630074006F00720069006100100003110100020100007300200063006F006E0074007200610020006D00ED002100100002011400150000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 53
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¿Te apetece participar en el Torneo Lilette\nSuprême Infinito en este momento, querid<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿāoa?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 1344,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 97
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Sí, quiero participar!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 1540,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A1005300ED002C002000710075006900650072006F0020007000610072007400690063006900700061007200210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¿Me lo puede explicar de nuevo?",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 1588,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00BF004D00650020006C006F0020007000750065006400650020006500780070006C00690063006100720020006400650020006E007500650076006F003F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 32
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Por ahora no",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 1652,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0050006F0072002000610068006F007200610020006E006F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 13
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Très bien!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 1680,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0054007200E800730020006200690065006E002100100002011400150000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 15
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Veamos... ¡Es hora del combate número <U+0010><U+0003>ȅ<U+0002> !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 1712,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "005600650061006D006F0073002E002E002E002000A10045007300200068006F00720061002000640065006C00200063006F006D00620061007400650020006E00FA006D00650072006F00200010000302050002202F002100100002011400150000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 49
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Recuerda que estaré aquí siempre que te plazca.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 1812,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00520065006300750065007200640061002000710075006500200065007300740061007200E9002000610071007500ED0020007300690065006D007000720065002000710075006500200074006500200070006C0061007A00630061002E00100002011400150000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 52
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Magnifique! ¿List<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿāoa para el siguiente combate?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 1916,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004D00610067006E0069006600690071007500650021002000BF004C00690073007400100003110000FF0101006F00610020007000610072006100200065006C0020007300690067007500690065006E0074006500200063006F006D0062006100740065003F00100002011400150000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 56
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Sigamos!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 2028,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A10053006900670061006D006F007300210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 10
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Quiero dejarlo",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 2048,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00510075006900650072006F002000640065006A00610072006C006F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 15
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Vaya, ¿de veras? ¿Tras solo <U+0010><U+0003>ȅ<U+0002>  combate<U+0010><U+0003>ᄁ<U+0002>Ās?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 9,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 2080,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0056006100790061002C002000BF00640065002000760065007200610073003F002000BF005400720061007300200073006F006C006F00200010000302050002202F00200063006F006D0062006100740065001000031101000201000073003F00100002011400150000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 53
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Pensándolo mejor, quiero seguir",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 2188,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00500065006E007300E1006E0064006F006C006F0020006D0065006A006F0072002C002000710075006900650072006F00200073006500670075006900720000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 32
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Sí, he tenido suficiente",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 2252,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "005300ED002C002000680065002000740065006E00690064006F00200073007500660069006300690065006E007400650000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 25
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Qué lástima... Pues yo quería combatir hasta\nla infinidad, pero se ve que tu tiempo es finito.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 2304,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 99
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>봆<U+0000>¡Esta vez has conseguido <U+0010><U+0003>ȅ<U+0002> \nvictoria<U+0010><U+0003>ᄁ<U+0002>਀s seguidas!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 12,
